    "body": "ZORR MODE\n\nTYPE = DOCUMENTED TRAINING / NORMALIZATION PLAN\nBASE_MAIN = d805242a8ba6e2b169c1216acd3df86b8f9ddd84\nRELATES = #198, #199, #201\n\nGoal: teach SALVADOR to normalize ZORR character source/evidence into a fixed front production presentation with no weapon on the character, while preserving character-specific identity/body/hair/costume/asymmetry and exporting any proven weapon separately.\n\nAcceleration law: `EXISTING ZORR -> COMFYUI NATIVE -> MATURE OSS -> MINIMAL GLUE -> LORA ONLY FOR PROVEN RESIDUAL GAP`.\n\nVISUAL TABOO #1 is now mandatory:\n`NO EXTERNAL AESTHETIC BINDINGS`.\n\nForbidden: external genre/style labels as authority, artist/studio/franchise/character comparisons, external images as style targets, or internet image search for aesthetic imitation. External research is technical-only: `OPEN CODE -> MATH -> ALGORITHMS -> DOCUMENTATION -> QC`.\n\nThe plan freezes:\n- mathematical pose/framing envelope;\n- weapon/body separation law;\n- #201 fail-closed visual-taboo rule;\n- reuse-first stack using ControlNet, IP-Adapter, native ComfyUI mask/inpaint, optional Grounding DINO + SAM2 proposals;\n- curriculum S0 inference baseline -> curated teacher targets -> global ZORR Style LoRA -> character-specific adaptation only if measured necessary;\n- quantitative pose/silhouette/style gates;\n- GOLDEN_12 holdout promotion gate;\n- deterministic provenance/hashes;\n- TDD implementation order that preserves existing `PRODUCTION_IMAGE_EDIT` smoke.\n\nPrivate Permanent Archive contains the full plan at:\n`/ZORR/PERMANENT_ARCHIVE_V1/PRODUCTION_LAWS/SALVADOR/FRONT_NORMALIZE_V1/`\n\nVisual Taboo #1 is also archived at:\n`/ZORR/PERMANENT_ARCHIVE_V1/PRODUCTION_LAWS/VISUAL_TABOO_1/`\n\nImportant truth boundary:\n`PLAN_PASS = YES`\n`VISUAL_TABOO_1_DURABLE = YES`\n`WORKFLOW_BASE_PASS = NOT_RUN`\n`STYLE_LORA_PASS = NOT_RUN`\n`SALVADOR_FRONT_NORMALIZER_PRODUCTION_PASS = NOT_RUN`\n\nThis PR changes documentation only. It must not be treated as evidence of physical ComfyUI/model-training PASS.",
